<iscomment>
    Included fragment of multisafepaySettings/settings. It must not declare its own
    content-type directive or run an inline server script here: doing so interfered
    with the new Business Manager page initialization (the "Application State JSON is
    not present in DOM" error). The Group Card Methods value is resolved in the
    controller and passed as pdict.groupCardsEnabled.
</iscomment>
<div id="requiredSettings" class="card bg-white mt-4">
   <div class="card-body">
      <h5 class="card-title mb-0">
         Account settings
      </h5>
      <div class="mt-3">
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="mode">Environment</label>
            <h7 id="modeHelp" class="form-text mb-1">Use the "Test" option in order to connect to your <a class="text-primary" href="https://testmerchant.multisafepay.com/" target="_blank">Multisafepay test environment</a>. Use live to connect to your <a class="text-primary" href="https://merchant.multisafepay.com/" target="_blank">Multisafepay Live environment</a>.</h7>
            <div class="radio-buttons">
               <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                  <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="Multisafepay_Environment" id="testRadio" value="test" ${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_Environment == 'test' ? 'checked': ''}>
                  <label class="form-check-label" for="testRadio">Test</label>
               </div>
               <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                  <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="Multisafepay_Environment" id="productionRadio" value="live" ${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_Environment == 'live' ? 'checked': ''}>
                  <label class="form-check-label" for="productionRadio">Live</label>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="testApiKey">Multisafepay Test API Key</label>
            <small id="testApiKeyHelp" class="form-text mb-1">
            <a class="text-primary" href="https://docs.multisafepay.com/docs/sites" target="_blank">How to set up your API key?</a> 
            Used when Environment is set to <strong>Test</strong>.
            </small>
            <div class="input-fields">
               <input type="text" class="form-control" name="Multisafepay_TestApiKey" id="testApiKey" aria-describedby="testApiKeyHelp" placeholder="" value="${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_TestApiKey || ''}">
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="liveApiKey">Multisafepay Live API Key</label>
            <small id="liveApiKeyHelp" class="form-text mb-1">
            Used when Environment is set to <strong>Live</strong>.
            </small>
            <div class="input-fields">
               <input type="text" class="form-control" name="Multisafepay_LiveApiKey" id="liveApiKey" aria-describedby="liveApiKeyHelp" placeholder="" value="${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_LiveApiKey || ''}">
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="capture">Multisafepay OMS Salesforce</label>
            <div class="row">
               <small id="captureHelp" class="col form-text mb-1">
                  Is your system integrated with Salesforce OMS?
               </small>
               <div class="col input-fields">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="Multisafepay_OMSOption" id="oms" aria-describedby="omsHelp" ${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_OMSOption == true ? 'checked': ''}>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="manualCapture">Manual Capture</label>
            <div class="row">
               <small id="manualCaptureHelp" class="col form-text mb-1">
                  Enable manual capture for payment methods that support it. When enabled, payments will be authorized but not captured automatically — use the Capture button in the order detail to capture.
               </small>
               <div class="col input-fields">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="Multisafepay_ManualCapture" id="manualCapture" aria-describedby="manualCaptureHelp" ${dw.system.Site.current.preferences.custom.Multisafepay_ManualCapture == true ? 'checked': ''}>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-title mb-0" for="groupCards">Group Card Methods</label>
            <div class="row">
               <small id="groupCardsHelp" class="col form-text mb-1">
                  When enabled, card schemes (Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Maestro) are grouped into a single "Credit Card" method (group_cards=1). When disabled, each card scheme is shown individually. Re-run "Sync &amp; Import" after changing this so the payment methods are rebuilt.
               </small>
               <div class="col input-fields">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="Multisafepay_GroupCards" id="groupCards" aria-describedby="groupCardsHelp" ${pdict.groupCardsEnabled ? 'checked': ''}>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</div>
